#6000
Immortal Map Room for the Blasted Desert~
   The Blasted Desert occupies an area to the northwest of the Black Sands
Desert. The Nixith area resides within the Blasted Desert.
~
60 cdgj 0
S
#6001
The Blasted Desert~
   The ground is pock-marked with obsidian-like natural glass. Something has
melted the black sand with intense heat, and formed a queer landscape - giant
crystalline spires of hardened silica twisting upward from the ground.
~
60 0 10
D1
~
~
0 0 6002
D2
~
~
0 0 6007
S
#6002
The Blasted Desert~
   All around you, deadly sand-geysers spew molten silica from behind crystal
monoliths. These giant spires buffer you against the full force of the geyser,
but the strength of even a partial blast could easily prove fatal.
~
